desc(
	mode: "source"
	language: "general"
	title: "Unirest Http Request"
	title_zh: "Unirest Http Request"
	type: vuln
	level: middle
	rule_id: "source-insecure-api-unirest-http-request"
	risk: "cleartext-transmission"
	desc: <<<DESC
### 规则说明
Checks for requests sent via Unirest to http:// URLS. This is dangerous because the server is attempting to connect to a website that does not encrypt traffic with TLS. Instead, send requests only to https:// URLS.

### 风险类型
明文传输（cleartext-transmission）

### 影响
敏感数据通过 HTTP 等明文通道传输，可能被网络窃听。

### 检测方式
Source 模式正则匹配，检测代码或配置中符合该风险模式的位置。

### 补充说明
Note: source-mode regex approximation of a safe-literal pattern.

### 参考
- CWE: CWE-319: Cleartext Transmission of Sensitive Information
DESC
	solution: <<<SOLUTION
### 修复建议
改用 HTTPS/TLS 传输，并确保所有敏感请求都走加密通道。

推荐修复：
Instead, send requests only to https:// URLS.
SOLUTION
	alert_min: 1
	"file://pos.java": <<<POS
Unirest.get("http://example.com")
POS
	"safefile://pos.java": <<<NEG
Unirest.get("https://example.com")
NEG
)

${*.java}.pattern_regex(/(?:Unirest\.(?:get|post)\(\s*["\'][hH][tT][tT][pP]:\/\/[^"\']*["\']\s*\))/) as $hit
alert $hit for {
	level: "middle",
	title: "Unirest Http Request",
	title_zh: "Unirest Http Request",
	message: "Unirest Http Request detected.",
}
